# Raw agent traces. Each log replays the whole conversation every turn, so a single
# run is hundreds of KB and the results directory reaches hundreds of MB. The tool
# sequence and counts that matter are folded into each run's JSON record by
# experiments/trace_stats.py, so the logs are reproducible working files, not results.
experiments/**/*.log
.venv-naive/

